[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 117 Tommy's breakfast Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.77,
    "end": 12.353,
    "zh": "第117课 汤米的早餐 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第117課 湯米的早餐 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "What does she mean by 'change'",
    "start": 13.457,
    "end": 16.978,
    "zh": "在最后一句中，",
    "zh_hant": "在最後一句中，"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "in the last sentence?",
    "start": 17.059,
    "end": 19.199,
    "zh": "她说的“零钱”是什么意思？",
    "zh_hant": "她說的“零錢”是什麼意思？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "When my husband was going",
    "start": 21.241,
    "end": 24.202,
    "zh": "当我丈夫今天早上",
    "zh_hant": "當我丈夫今天早上"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "into the dining room",
    "start": 23.942,
    "end": 25.963,
    "zh": "走进餐厅",
    "zh_hant": "走進餐廳"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "this morning,",
    "start": 25.613,
    "end": 26.923,
    "zh": "的时候，",
    "zh_hant": "的時候，"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "he dropped some coins on the floor.",
    "start": 27.124,
    "end": 30.665,
    "zh": "他把一些硬币掉在了地上。",
    "zh_hant": "他把一些硬幣掉在了地上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "There were coins everywhere.",
    "start": 31.606,
    "end": 34.487,
    "zh": "硬币到处都是。",
    "zh_hant": "硬幣到處都是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "We looked for them, but we could not find",
    "start": 34.888,
    "end": 39.109,
    "zh": "我们找了一会儿，但是没能找到",
    "zh_hant": "我們找了一會兒，但是沒能找到"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "them all.",
    "start": 38.759,
    "end": 39.95,
    "zh": "所有的硬币。",
    "zh_hant": "所有的硬幣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "While we were having breakfast,",
    "start": 41.131,
    "end": 44.152,
    "zh": "当我们正在吃早餐时，",
    "zh_hant": "當我們正在吃早餐時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "our little boy,",
    "start": 44.373,
    "end": 46.234,
    "zh": "我们的小男孩，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的小男孩，"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Tommy, found two small coins",
    "start": 46.254,
    "end": 50.416,
    "zh": "汤米，发现了两枚小硬币",
    "zh_hant": "湯米，發現了兩枚小硬幣"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "on the floor.",
    "start": 50.176,
    "end": 51.516,
    "zh": "在地上。",
    "zh_hant": "在地上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "He put them both into his mouth.",
    "start": 52.517,
    "end": 56.138,
    "zh": "他把两枚硬币都放进了嘴里。",
    "zh_hant": "他把兩枚硬幣都放進了嘴裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "We both tried to get the coins,",
    "start": 57.099,
    "end": 60.461,
    "zh": "我们俩都想把硬币拿出来，",
    "zh_hant": "我們倆都想把硬幣拿出來，"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "but it was too late.",
    "start": 60.461,
    "end": 63.162,
    "zh": "但是太晚了。",
    "zh_hant": "但是太晚了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Tommy had already",
    "start": 63.482,
    "end": 66.303,
    "zh": "汤米已经",
    "zh_hant": "湯米已經"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "swallowed them!",
    "start": 66.324,
    "end": 68.044,
    "zh": "把它们吞下去了！",
    "zh_hant": "把它們吞下去了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Late that morning,",
    "start": 69.865,
    "end": 71.766,
    "zh": "那天上午晚些时候，",
    "zh_hant": "那天上午晚些時候，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "when I was doing the housework,",
    "start": 71.786,
    "end": 75.128,
    "zh": "当我正在做家务时，",
    "zh_hant": "當我正在做家務時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "My husband phoned me from the office.",
    "start": 75.388,
    "end": 79.51,
    "zh": "我丈夫从办公室给我打来电话。",
    "zh_hant": "我丈夫從辦公室給我打來電話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "'How's Tommy?'",
    "start": 80.292,
    "end": 81.813,
    "zh": "“汤米怎么样？”",
    "zh_hant": "“湯米怎麼樣？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "he asked.",
    "start": 81.973,
    "end": 83.274,
    "zh": "他问道。",
    "zh_hant": "他問道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "'I don't know,'",
    "start": 82.935,
    "end": 85.837,
    "zh": "“我不知道，”",
    "zh_hant": "“我不知道，”"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "I answered,",
    "start": 85.738,
    "end": 86.939,
    "zh": "我回答道，",
    "zh_hant": "我回答道，"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "'Tommy's been to the toilet",
    "start": 87.44,
    "end": 90.002,
    "zh": "“汤米今天早上已经",
    "zh_hant": "“湯米今天早上已經"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "three times this morning,",
    "start": 89.983,
    "end": 92.365,
    "zh": "去过三次厕所了，",
    "zh_hant": "去過三次廁所了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "but I haven't had any change yet!'",
    "start": 92.626,
    "end": 96.61,
    "zh": "但是我还没有任何零钱呢！”",
    "zh_hant": "但是我還沒有任何零錢呢！”"
  }
]
